{"symbol":"VSH","area":"sp500","updated":"2026-11-09T23:05:19Z","info":{"address1":"63 Lancaster Avenue","city":"Malvern","state":"PA","zip":"19355-2143","country":"United States","phone":"610 644 1300","website":"https://www.vishay.com","industry":"Electronic Components","industryKey":"electronic-components","industryDisp":"Electronic Components","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. manufactures and sells discrete semiconductors and passive electronic components in the United States, Germany, rest of Europe, Israel, and Asia. The company operates through six segments: Metal Oxide Semiconductor Field Effect Transistors (MOSFETs), Diodes, Optoelectronic Components, Resistors, Inductors, and Capacitors segments. The MOSFETs segment offers low- and medium-voltage TrenchFET MOSFETs, high-voltage planar MOSFETs, high voltage Super Junction MOSFETs, power integrated circuits, and integrated function power devices. The Diodes segment provides rectifiers, small signal diodes, protection diodes, thyristors/silicon-controlled rectifiers, and power modules. The Optoelectronic Components segment offers standard and customer specific optoelectronic components, such as infrared (IR) emitters and detectors, IR remote control receivers, optocouplers, solid-state relays, optical sensors, light-emitting diodes, 7-segment displays, and IR data transceiver modules. The Resistors segment provides resistors used in various forms of electronic circuitry to adjust and regulate levels of voltage and current. The Inductors segment provides inductors for use as an internal magnetic field to change alternating current phase and resist alternating current. The Capacitors segment offers capacitors that store energy and discharge. It sells its products under the Siliconix, Dale, Draloric, Beyschlag, Sfernice, MCB, UltraSource, Applied Thin-Film Products, IHLP, HiRel Systems, Sprague, Vitramon, Barry, Roederstein, ESTA, Ametherm, and BCcomponents brand names. The company serves automotive, industrial, computing, consumer, telecommunications, military, aerospace, and healthcare markets. Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. was incorporated in 1962 and is headquartered in Malvern, Pennsylvania.","fullTimeEmployees":22600,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marc  Zandman","age":63,"title":"Executive Chairman & Chief Business Development Officer","yearBorn":1962,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":2263724,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Joel  Smejkal","age":58,"title":"President, CEO & Director","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":2089239,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. David E. McConnell","age":58,"title":"Executive VP & CFO","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":846833,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Roy  Shoshani","age":51,"title":"Executive VP, COO of Semiconductors & CTO","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1542827,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Peter G. Henrici","age":69,"title":"Executive VP of Corporate Development & Corporate Secretary","yearBorn":1956,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":678627,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Rafi  Ouzan","age":59,"title":"Chief Operating Officer","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. David L. Tomlinson","age":50,"title":"Senior VP & Chief Accounting Officer","yearBorn":1975,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Michael  O'Sullivan","age":50,"title":"Executive VP and Chief Administrative & Legal Officer","yearBorn":1975,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Geoff  Taylor","title":"Senior Vice President of Quality","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert Barrett Ha